      "sha256": "83489a0f0752e22410d7534cdbe0b89726f00012d869e1b868e8127f5bcc573c",
      "text": "Role-first: kullanıcıya tüm sistemi değil, rolünün o anda yapması gereken işi göster."
    },
    {
      "source_path": "analiz/POSEIDON GUNCEL 30.10.2026/04_UX_PRODUCT_DESIGN/13.04_POSEIDON_v46.3_Design_System_ve_UX_Standartlari_TR.docx",
      "locator": "paragraph:20",
      "sha256": "83489a0f0752e22410d7534cdbe0b89726f00012d869e1b868e8127f5bcc573c",
      "text": "Mode-aware: Ship ve Tug ekranları ortak core'u paylaşır ancak operasyon ritmi ve terminoloji karıştırılmaz."
    },
    {
      "source_path": "analiz/POSEIDON GUNCEL 30.10.2026/04_UX_PRODUCT_DESIGN/13.04_POSEIDON_v46.3_Design_System_ve_UX_Standartlari_TR.docx",
      "locator": "paragraph:21",
      "sha256": "83489a0f0752e22410d7534cdbe0b89726f00012d869e1b868e8127f5bcc573c",
      "text": "Manage by Exception: normal durumlar geri planda, attention/blocker/decision önde."
    },
    {
      "source_path": "analiz/POSEIDON GUNCEL 30.10.2026/04_UX_PRODUCT_DESIGN/13.04_POSEIDON_v46.3_Design_System_ve_UX_Standartlari_TR.docx",
      "locator": "paragraph:22",
      "sha256": "83489a0f0752e22410d7534cdbe0b89726f00012d869e1b868e8127f5bcc573c",
      "text": "Explainability: readiness/compliance state tek renk veya puan değildir; Why görünümü source→control→evidence→owner→next action verir."
    },
    {
      "source_path": "analiz/POSEIDON GUNCEL 30.10.2026/04_UX_PRODUCT_DESIGN/13.04_POSEIDON_v46.3_Design_System_ve_UX_Standartlari_TR.docx",
      "locator": "paragraph:23",
      "sha256": "83489a0f0752e22410d7534cdbe0b89726f00012d869e1b868e8127f5bcc573c",
      "text": "Human authority: safety/legal kritik karar butonları yetkili rol ve state olmadan aktif olamaz."
    },
    {
      "source_path": "analiz/POSEIDON GUNCEL 30.10.2026/04_UX_PRODUCT_DESIGN/13.04_POSEIDON_v46.3_Design_System_ve_UX_Standartlari_TR.docx",
